Rule 4 (out tensor matches input tensor in dtype and shape to avoid casting issues)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_3) ∧ ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_3) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_3, i)
>>
Rule 5 (finite, half-safe outputs via eps-domain clamping)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : float} |= if v_2 > 0 then min(v_1) ≥ v_2 ∧ max(v_1) ≤ 1 - v_2 else min(v_1) > 0 ∧ max(v_1) < 1
